My Solution :-

Entities:
user (userId, List<Ticket>, name)
city (cityId, name)
cinema (cinemaId, name, cityId)
screen (screenid, cinemaId, name)
seat (seatNo, screenId, SeatType)
SeatType (Standard, Premium, VIP)
Pricing (Dynamic -> should be strategy at runtime)
show (showId, movieId, startTime, endTime, screenId)
movie (movieId, title, language, genre, duration)
order/ticket (orderId, orderTime, List<seats>, show, status, userId)
payment (status, paymentId, amount)
PaymentService (processPayment())

User journey:
select movie -> select cinema -> select screen -> select seat -> lock seat -> move to payment ->
if (selected seat available) -> do payment -> check seat lock status (10 min timeout) -> confirm order -> create ticket